[{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0113","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0113.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-16668","title":"CIRCONTROL CirCarLife 内部安装路径泄露漏洞","description":"CIRCONTROL CirCarLife（电动汽车充电管理系统）4.3 之前版本中存在信息泄露漏洞。由于 `/html/repository` 接口未进行身份认证，未经身份验证的远程攻击者可直接访问该路径，获取系统内部安装路径等敏感信息，为后续攻击提供线索。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需任何权限，CVSS 评分 5.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2018-16668"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-09-18T20:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:44:39Z","remediation":"升级 CirCarLife 至 4.3.0 或更高版本（厂商已修复该路径泄露问题）。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器（如 Nginx/Apache）层面为 `/html/repository` 路径添加 HTTP 基本认证或 IP 白名单访问控制，仅允许管理网段访问 SCADA Web 管理界面（默认端口 80/8080），同时禁用不必要的目录列表功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/SadFud/Exploits/tree/master/Real%20World/Suites/cir-pwn-life","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45384/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16668.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-16668.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/38e315e25498e9628d3adfa5823d07fd5ba15a1d/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16668.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-16668.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-16668-3386.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-16668-3383.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-16668-3385.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-16668_重复副本.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2018-16668.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/CirCarLife Scada/CVE-2018-16668.yaml","https://github.com/zan8in/afrog/blob/9c47a2b9b7e12375757acdfbc179354920c87bd8/pocs/afrog-pocs/CVE/2018/CVE-2018-16668.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0113.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0113.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0122","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0122.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-17153","title":"Western Digital My Cloud 身份验证绕过漏洞","description":"Western Digital My Cloud 网络附加存储设备（固件版本低于 2.30.196）存在身份验证绕过漏洞。该漏洞源于 network_mgr.cgi 模块中的 cgi_get_ipv6 命令在处理请求时未正确验证用户身份，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标设备发送带有 flag=1 参数的 HTTP 请求直接创建绑定自身 IP 地址的有效管理员会话，随后在后续请求中设置 Cookie 为 username=admin 即可绕过身份验证，以管理员权限调用所有需要认证的 CGI 模块，从而完全控制目标设备，包括读取、修改或删除存储数据。攻击无需任何用户交互或凭证，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-17153"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-09-18T15:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:45:26Z","remediation":"立即将 Western Digital My Cloud 固件升级至 2.30.196 或更高版本，该版本已修复 network_mgr.cgi 模块中 cgi_get_ipv6 命令无需认证即可创建管理员会话的问题。如无法立即升级，可在设备管理界面禁用远程管理功能，并在网络防火墙中限制对设备 80/443 端口的访问来源 IP，仅允许受信任的管理员 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/173802/Western-Digital-MyCloud-Unauthenticated-Command-Injection.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/105359","https://securify.nl/nl/advisory/SFY20180102/authentication-bypass-vulnerability-in-western-digital-my-cloud-allows-escalation-to-admin-privileges.html","https://support.wdc.com/knowledgebase/answer.aspx?ID=25952","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-17153.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-17153.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/b1d25fc0e9d16a9b11c9961a087f80d3b00bf9e5/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-17153.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2018-17153.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-17153.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2018/17xxx/CVE-2018-17153.json","https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework/blob/eac2926b138d2c21c1927fef7b940261b9b516f7/modules/exploits/linux/http/wd_mycloud_unauthenticated_cmd_injection.rb","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-17153.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-17153.md","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/dce139c84c439e9fc87d0eb2079ddda89aaeb75c/plugins/western_digital/my_cloud_wdbctl0020hwt_firmware/CVE-2018-17153.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder1/CVE-2018-17153.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0122.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0122.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0121","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0121.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-17082","title":"PHP Apache2 SAPI 跨站脚本攻击","description":"PHP 的 Apache2 SAPI 组件中的 `php_handler` 函数在处理 `Transfer-Encoding: chunked` 请求时，未正确管理 Apache 的 bucket brigade 数据结构，导致攻击者可通过在分块传输编码的请求体中注入恶意 HTML/JavaScript 代码触发反射型跨站脚本攻击。该漏洞影响 PHP 5.6.38 之前版本、7.0.32 之前版本、7.1.22 之前版本及 7.2.10 之前版本。攻击者无需身份认证，仅需诱使目标用户访问特制 URL 即可在用户浏览器中执行任意脚本，窃取会话凭证或实施钓鱼攻击。CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-17082"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-09-16T15:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:45:20Z","remediation":"升级 PHP 至 5.6.38、7.0.32、7.1.22 或 7.2.10 及以上版本，该漏洞已在 commit 23b05774 中修复。如无法立即升级，可在 Apache 配置中禁用 Transfer-Encoding: chunked 请求体传递，或部署 WAF 规则拦截含分块编码的异常请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://php.net/ChangeLog-5.php","http://php.net/ChangeLog-7.php","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2019:2519","https://bugs.php.net/bug.php?id=76582","https://github.com/php/php-src/commit/23b057742e3cf199612fa8050ae86cae675e214e","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2018/09/msg00020.html","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/201812-01","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20180924-0001/","https://www.debian.org/security/2018/dsa-4353","https://www.tenable.com/security/tns-2019-07","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-17082.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-17082.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/b1d25fc0e9d16a9b11c9961a087f80d3b00bf9e5/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-17082.yaml","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/dce139c84c439e9fc87d0eb2079ddda89aaeb75c/plugins/php/php/CVE-2018-17082.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2018/17xxx/CVE-2018-17082.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-17082.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-17082.md","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2018/CVE-2018-17082.md","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2018/CVE-2018-17082.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2018-17082.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-17082.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0121.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0121.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0121.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0105","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0105.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-16288","title":"LG SuperSign CMS 文件读取漏洞","description":"LG SuperSign CMS 存在路径遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 signEzUI/playlist/edit/upload/ 接口发送包含 `..%2f` 序列的特制 URI 请求，突破目录限制读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 LG SuperSign EZ CMS 2.5 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 8.6，危害等级高。攻击者只需能够访问目标 Web 管理界面即可利用，攻击复杂度低。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.6,"aliases":["CVE-2018-16288"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-09-14T21:29:04Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:44:02Z","remediation":"立即将 LG SuperSign CMS 升级至厂商提供的最新版本（如有）；若产品已停止维护，建议在前置反向代理（如 Nginx/Apache）中添加规则，拦截包含 `..%2f` 或 `../` 等目录遍历特征的请求路径，同时限制 `/signEzUI/playlist/edit/upload/` 路径仅允许认证用户访问，并在 Web 服务器层面禁用不必要的目录列表功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://mamaquieroserpentester.blogspot.com/2018/09/multiple-vulnerabilities-in-lg.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45440/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45440","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16288.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-16288.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/38e315e25498e9628d3adfa5823d07fd5ba15a1d/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16288.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-16288.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-16288-3368.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-16288-3365.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-16288-3366.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-16288-3369.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2018-16288.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-16288.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2018/16xxx/CVE-2018-16288.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0105.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-1109","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-1109.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-8440","title":"Microsoft Windows ALPC 特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows 高级本地过程调用（ALPC）机制存在特权提升漏洞。其原理是由于 Windows 在处理 ALPC 调用时存在逻辑处理不当，导致攻击者能够通过发送特制的本地请求，在内核空间触发漏洞从而实现从低权限用户到系统最高权限（SYSTEM）的提升。该漏洞影响范围广泛，包括 Windows 7、Windows 8.1、Windows 10 以及 Windows Server 2008/2012/2016 等多个版本。攻击者仅需在目标系统上获得低权限的本地访问权限，即可通过运行恶意利用程序触发该漏洞，从而完全控制受影响的系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-8440"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-09-13T00:29:04Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:04:52Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2018 年 9 月的安全更新（累积更新 KB4038... 系列），或通过 Windows Update 自动更新到最新补丁版本。对于受影响的 Windows 7、8.1 及 Windows Server 各版本，请确保安装对应的 OS 累积更新以修复 ALPC 句柄处理缺陷。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/105153","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1041578","https://blog.0patch.com/2018/08/how-we-micropatched-publicly-dropped.html","https://blog.0patch.com/2018/09/comparing-our-micropatch-with.html","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2018-8440","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-8440","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-8440.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f7fdc93b8d4d470f2c23e4fffbdda828848b6048/2018/CVE-2018-8440.json","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/TestFailure/CVE-2018-8440/README.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/TestFailure/CVE-2018-8440/README_EN.md","https://github.com/SecWiki/windows-kernel-exploits/blob/2b944b52ee30f8833a21f0805d2627ca1f15383a/README.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-8440.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-8440.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/15f9f7a0b2cc2a296dac75e46487bfa653db3e1b/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-8440.json","https://github.com/rayhan0x01/reverse-shell-able-exploit-pocs/blob/34d99d62301de08cf5e5522682c476fcfb56a9c6/CVE-2018-8440.md","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2018/CVE-2018-8440.md","https://github.com/sourceincite/CVE-2018-8440"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-1109.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0120","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0120.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-16979","title":"Monstra CMS HTTP响应头注入漏洞","description":"Monstra CMS 3.0.4 的 plugins/captcha/crypt/cryptographp.php 文件中 cfg 参数存在 HTTP 响应头注入漏洞（CRLF 注入，CWE-113）。远程攻击者可通过向 cfg 参数注入 CRLF 序列（%0d%0a）来插入任意 HTTP 响应头或分割响应体，结合用户交互（如点击恶意链接）可触发反射型 XSS 攻击或 HTTP 响应缓存投毒。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证，影响 Monstra CMS 3.0.4 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-16979"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-09-12T23:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:45:09Z","remediation":"立即升级 Monstra CMS 至 3.0.5 或更高版本（如官方已发布）。若官方未发布修复版本，手动修改 plugins/captcha/crypt/cryptographp.php，对 cfg 参数进行 CRLF 字符过滤：在接收 cfg 参数后使用 preg_replace('/[\\r\\n]/', '', $_GET['cfg']) 去除换行符，防止 HTTP 响应头注入。同时建议迁移至其他仍在维护的 CMS 系统，因 Monstra CMS 项目已长期未更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/howchen/howchen/issues/4","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16979.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-16979.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/b1d25fc0e9d16a9b11c9961a087f80d3b00bf9e5/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16979.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-16979.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/CRLF/CVE-2018-16979.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2018/16xxx/CVE-2018-16979.json","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-16979.yaml","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/dce139c84c439e9fc87d0eb2079ddda89aaeb75c/plugins/monstra/monstra/CVE-2018-16979.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-16979.md","https://github.com/Akokonunes/Private-Nuclei-Templates/blob/f92d2274458a958ed01345915693cf1dbe026f83/CRLF/CVE-2018-16979.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-16979.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0120.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0119","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0119.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-16836","title":"Rubedo CMS 主题组件目录遍历漏洞","description":"Rubedo CMS 3.4.0及之前版本的主题组件存在目录遍历漏洞（CWE-22），未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造包含`%2e%2e/`等编码路径穿越序列的恶意URI（如`/theme/default/img/%2e%2e/..//etc/passwd`），突破服务根目录限制，实现任意文件读取与执行。该漏洞CVSS评分9.8，危害等级严重，可导致服务器敏感信息泄露及远程代码执行，影响所有使用Rubedo CMS的Web应用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-16836"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-09-11T16:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:44:52Z","remediation":"Rubedo CMS 官方已停止维护，无安全补丁可用。建议立即迁移至其他受支持的 CMS 平台。如无法迁移，可采取以下缓解措施：(1) 在 Web 服务器（Nginx/Apache）层面配置规则，拦截包含 `%2e%2e`、`..//` 等路径遍历特征的 URI 请求；(2) 在应用入口处对 `theme/default/img/` 路径参数进行规范化校验，拒绝包含 `../` 或编码后路径穿越字符的请求；(3) 限制 Web 服务进程对文件系统的读取权限，仅允许访问 `webroot` 目录下的必要资源；(4) 部署 WAF（如 ModSecurity）并启用路径遍历攻击防护规则集。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/maroueneboubakri/CVE/tree/master/rubedo-cms","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45385/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45385","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16836.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-16836.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/986b45a0ac2dd215b3a5515fba0cebac769043dd/2018/CVE-2018-16836.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/b1d25fc0e9d16a9b11c9961a087f80d3b00bf9e5/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16836.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2018-16836.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-16836-3410.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-16836-3406.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-16836-3408.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Rubedo/CVE-2018-16836.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-16836.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2018/16xxx/CVE-2018-16836.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0119.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0118","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0118.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-16763","title":"FUEL CMS 1.4.1 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"FUEL CMS 1.4.1 存在 PHP 代码注入漏洞，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过 pages/select/ 接口的 filter 参数或 preview/ 接口的 data 参数注入恶意 PHP 代码，实现远程代码执行。该漏洞源于程序对用户输入过滤不严，导致攻击者可完全控制目标服务器，获取系统权限。CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重，影响所有运行 FUEL CMS 1.4.1 版本的系统。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-16763"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-09-09T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:44:46Z","remediation":"立即升级至 FUEL CMS 1.4.13 或更高版本（最新版为 1.5.2）。1.4.13 版本已包含安全补丁 commit b14b294，移除了 `fuel_model` 函数默认配置中的 `parser_allowed_functions` 选项，并新增 `allow_inline_actions` 配置项。如无法立即升级，可在 `fuel/application/config/MY_fuel.php` 中将 `parser_allowed_functions` 配置项清空，禁止在模板中执行 PHP 代码，同时在 Web 服务器（Nginx/Apache）层面限制对 `/fuel/pages/select/` 和 `/fuel/preview` 路径的未授权访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/153696/fuelCMS-1.4.1-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/160080/Fuel-CMS-1.4-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/164756/Fuel-CMS-1.4.1-Remote-Code-Execution.html","https://0xd0ff9.wordpress.com/2019/07/19/from-code-evaluation-to-pre-auth-remote-code-execution-cve-2018-16763-bypass/","https://github.com/daylightstudio/FUEL-CMS/issues/478","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47138","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/50477","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16763.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-16763.md","h