pdated":"2026-06-17T01:44:46Z","remediation":"升级 Eventum 至 v3.4.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复开放重定向漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器（Nginx/Apache）层面配置 URL 白名单规则，限制外部重定向目标域名，或禁用 `redirect.php` 等存在重定向功能的页面。同时建议对用户输入的重定向参数进行严格校验，仅允许跳转到可信域名。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/eventum/eventum/releases/tag/v3.4.0","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16761.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-16761.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/b1d25fc0e9d16a9b11c9961a087f80d3b00bf9e5/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16761.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-16761.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-16761-3398.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-16761-3399.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/Open Redirect/CVE-2018-16761.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2018/16xxx/CVE-2018-16761.json","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16761.yaml","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/d8cd4a1ae21f91a5e3337a6b189b078a1a73a4aa/plugins/eventum_project/eventum/CVE-2018-16761.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-16761.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0117.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0112","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0112.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-16363","title":"WordPress File Manager 插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 mndpsingh287 File Manager 插件 2.9 版本中存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，位于 wp-admin/admin.php?page=wp_file_manager 页面的 lang 参数。由于 file_folder_manager.php 中使用了 set_transient 函数且 lib\\wpfilemanager.php 直接对 lang 参数进行 echo 输出，未进行充分的过滤与转义，导致攻击者可向已登录的管理员用户发送特制链接，诱使其点击后在当前页面上下文中执行任意 JavaScript 代码。该漏洞利用条件为攻击者需拥有低权限用户身份且需用户交互，影响范围涉及插件版本 2.9，可导致敏感信息泄露与页面内容篡改。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2018-16363"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-09-07T22:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:44:09Z","remediation":"立即将 WP File Manager 插件升级至 3.0 或更高版本（3.0 于 2018-09-05 发布，已修复此 XSS 漏洞）。如无法立即升级，可在 WordPress 后台 → 用户 → 所有用户中，将可能访问 wp-admin 的用户角色权限降至最低，避免低权限用户触发 lang 参数注入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blog.51cto.com/010bjsoft/2171087","https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/changeset/1936043","https://wordpress.org/support/topic/security-concern-6/#post-10655739","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/9126","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16363.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-16363.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/38e315e25498e9628d3adfa5823d07fd5ba15a1d/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16363.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2018/16xxx/CVE-2018-16363.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-16363.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-16363.md","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/CVE-2018-16363.yaml","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/cb3bd36094377a25dbc2de0dacc69b62a09f7685/nuclei-templates/2018/CVE-2018-16363-wp_file_manager-69e92c75-5b14-43d9-a169-a1f8b51ab41d.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-16363.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2018-16363.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16363.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0112.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0097","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0097.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-16059","title":"Endress+Hauser WirelessHART Fieldgate SWG70 路径遍历漏洞","description":"Endress+Hauser WirelessHART Fieldgate SWG70 3.x 版本存在路径遍历漏洞，攻击者可通过向 fcgi-bin/wgsetcgi 脚本的 filename 参数传递包含 ../ 等目录跳转序列的恶意请求，绕过路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞影响 WirelessHART Fieldgate SWG70 3.0 及后续版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，可能导致敏感配置文件泄露。厂商已发布安全更新建议升级至修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2018-16059"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-09-07T22:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:43:37Z","remediation":"立即联系 Endress+Hauser 技术支持获取并升级 WirelessHART Fieldgate SWG70 固件至最新版本（该漏洞影响 3.x 全版本，厂商已发布修复固件）。在无法立即升级的情况下，在防火墙或反向代理层面限制对 fcgi-bin/wgsetcgi 接口的访问，仅允许受信任的管理 IP 访问设备 Web 管理界面，并对 filename 参数实施严格的路径白名单校验，禁止包含 ../ 等目录遍历序列。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/107416","https://cert.vde.com/en-us/advisories/vde-2019-002","https://ics-cert.us-cert.gov/advisories/ICSA-19-073-03","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45342/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45342","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16059.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-16059.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/38e315e25498e9628d3adfa5823d07fd5ba15a1d/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16059.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-16059.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-16059-3353.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-16059-3351.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-16059-3350.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-16059-3354.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2018-16059.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Endress+Hauser WirelessHART Fieldgate SWG70/CVE-2018-16059.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2018/16xxx/CVE-2018-16059.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0097.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0026","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0026.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-1000671","title":"Sympa 邮件列表管理系统 开放重定向与反射型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Sympa 6.2.16 及更高版本在 `wwsympa.fcgi` 登录操作的 `referer` 参数中存在 URL 重定向漏洞（CWE-601）。攻击者可以通过构造包含恶意 Data URI 的特制链接，诱导受害者访问，从而实现开放重定向以及反射型跨站脚本（XSS）攻击。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本的 Sympa 实例，攻击条件为受害者必须点击并跳转攻击者提供的 URL。利用此漏洞可导致受害者浏览器执行恶意脚本或被引导至钓鱼网站，从而窃取敏感信息或接管用户会话。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-1000671"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-09-06T18:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:33:04Z","remediation":"建议升级 Sympa 至最新稳定版本以获取安全修复。如无法立即升级，可通过修改 wwsympa.fcgi 源代码，对 referer 参数实施严格的白名单校验，仅允许重定向至信任的本站域名，从而根治开放重定向与反射型 XSS 漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/sympa-community/sympa/issues/268","https://lists.debian.org/