录系统，利用难度较低。该漏洞影响 Jorani 0.6.5 版本，CVSS 评分 5.4，危害等级中危。建议升级至最新版本修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2018-15917"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-09-05T21:29:02Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:43:19Z","remediation":"升级 Jorani 至最新版本 v1.0.4（从 https://github.com/jorani/jorani/releases/tag/v1.0.4 下载），该版本已修复多项安全漏洞并支持 PHP 8.5。如无法立即升级，在 application/config/config.php 中对 language 参数做 HTML 实体编码过滤，或部署 WAF 规则拦截包含 `<script>` 标签的 language 参数请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/bbalet/jorani/issues/254","https://hackpuntes.com/cve-2018-15917-jorani-leave-management-system-0-6-5-cross-site-scripting-persistente/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45338/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45338","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-15917.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-15917.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/38e315e25498e9628d3adfa5823d07fd5ba15a1d/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-15917.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-15917.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2018/15xxx/CVE-2018-15917.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/d8cd4a1ae21f91a5e3337a6b189b078a1a73a4aa/plugins/jorani_project/jorani/CVE-2018-15917.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-15917.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-15917.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-15917.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-15917.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6